#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:32
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&klipper; is the &plasma; clipboard utility. It stores clipboard history, "
#| "and allows you to link clipboard contents to application actions. Please "
#| "report any problems or feature requests to <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde."
#| "org\">KDEs bugzilla</ulink>."
msgid ""
"&klipper; is the &plasma; clipboard utility. It stores clipboard history, "
"and allows you to link clipboard contents to application actions. Please "
"report any problems or feature requests to <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org"
"\">KDE’s Bugtracking System</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&klipper; adalah utilitas papan klip &plasma;. Yang menyimpankan histori "
"papan klip, dan memungkinkan kamu untuk menautkan konten  papan klip "
"terhadap aksi aplikasi. Silakan laporkan permasalahan apa pun atau fitur "
"yang diminta ke <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org\">KDEs bugzilla</ulink>."

