"menangkap barcode dan menyimpannya."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can search through the clipboard history by opening it (click on "
#| "&klipper;) and typing your query. The results are updated as you type. To "
#| "clear the clipboard history click on the icon at the right of the search "
#| "field."
msgid ""
"You can search through the clipboard history by typing your query into the "
"search field. The results are updated as you type. To clear the clipboard "
"history, click on the icon at the right of the search field."
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa mencari melalui histori papan klip dengan membukanya (klik pada "
"&klipper;) dan mengetik query-mu. Hasilnya akan di-pembaruan sebagai apa "
"yang kamu ketik. Untuk membersihkan histori papan klip, klik pada ikon di "
"sebelah kanan bidang pencarian."

